  "title": "Sorta Salisbury Steak",
  "description": "Cubed round steaks and onions in a rich beefy gravy. A dish that goes well with mashed potatoes or noodles.",
  "authors": [
    "Nanci"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:09:04-04:00",
